        "@value": "the mare or refuse after oil is pressed from flax-seed, rape-seed, coco-nut pulp, &c., which is imported for feeding cattle, and for manure, to the extent of about 83,000 tons a-year, besides fully as much more made at home. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 276]",
