      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "In Commerce, the grains of several species of *gramina*. Those of most importance are clover seed, flax or linseed, hemp seed, rape seed, tares, mustard seed &c.; for which, see the respective articles. [J. R. McCulloch, Dictionary of Commerce and Commercial Navigation (1880), scan p. 1352]",
