          "@value": "Curated classification (processing_state=raw_unprocessed): Processing state: whole nuts/kernels/seeds/peas are unprocessed; classifier matched 'expressing Oil', 'Ground (nuts)' or 'Split'. Layer-1 observations: 126 rows, 1856–1906. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×126. Units: Qrs. (Quarters) ×126. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×11; Russia → United Kingdom ×8; Germany → United Kingdom ×8; British India Madras → United Kingdom ×6.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
