    {
      "@id": "htc:07/0707/#concept",
      "@type": [
        "skos:Concept",
        "crm:E55_Type"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": {
        "@value": "Extracts Unenumerated",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "htc:scheme/#resource"
      },
      "skos:notation": "0707",
      "skos:prefLabel": {
        "@value": "Extracts Unenumerated",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "skos:broader": {
        "@id": "htc:grp/grp_customs_residuals/#concept"
      },
      "oe:observationCount/#resource": 46,
      "oe:groundingStatus/#resource": "grounded_wikidata_lexical",
      "oe:substanceHead/#resource": "Extracts",
      "oe:processingState/#resource": "unspecified",
      "oe:ghostAcresDomain/#resource": "other",
      "oe:attestationBasis/#resource": "customs_enumerated",
      "oe:landBasis/#resource": "unclassified",
      "oe:harvestMode/#resource": "unclassified",
      "oe:theodoridisBucket/#resource": "unclassified",
      "oe:sitcCode/#resource": "oe:sitcUnassigned",
      "oe:isAggregate/#resource": false,
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "(_Extraits_, Fr.; _Extracten_, Germ.) The older apothecaries used this term to designate the product of the evaporation of any vegetable juice, infusion, or decoction; whether the latter two were made with water, alcohol, or ether; whence arose the distinction of aqueous, alcoholic, and ethereous extracts. Fourcroy made many researches upon these preparations, and supposed that they had all a common basis, which he called the _extractive_ principle. But Chevreul and other chemists have since proved that this pretended principle is a heterogeneous and very variable compound. [Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (Project Gutenberg #44562)]",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "oe:dictionarySource/#resource": [
        {
          "@id": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/44562"
        }
      ],
      "oe:firstAttested/#resource": 1821,
      "oe:lastAttested/#resource": 1896,
      "prov:hadPrimarySource": [
