          "@value": "Curated classification (group=grp_fodder_oilcakes; processing_state=byproduct_cake): Rape and linseed cakes are oil-press residues fed to cattle, same class as Oil Seed Cake (htc:0323). Layer-1 observations: 19 rows, 1800–1825. Series: KEW_CUST 4 ×13; KEW_CUST 5 ×6. Units: Hundredweights.Quarters.Pounds ×13; Tons ×6. Top routes: Canada → England ×8; Canada → Other English Ports ×3; Canada → Great Britain ×2; France → United Kingdom ×1.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
