        "@value": "There were exported in 1878 painters' colours the produce of the United Kingdom of the value of 1,134,627*l.*, as against 1,195,837*l.* in 1877, the principal quantities going to Australia, British India, France, the United States, British North America, Russia and Germany. [J. R. McCulloch, Dictionary of Commerce and Commercial Navigation (1880), scan p. 1902]",
