      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a mass of metal or wood thick at one end, and thin at the other, used for rending wood and other substances; a lever; a mechanical power or tool of various kinds and modifications; a small fastening for a door or window. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 421]",
