        "@value": "a framework of wood or metal, to support a bed. Bedsteads bear various names, according to shape and size, and are largely manufactured for home use. Iron and brass ones are also shipped. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 44]",
