      },
      "skos:scopeNote": {
        "@value": "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0822 (Esparto and other Vegetable Fibres for making Paper). Attested in: J. R. McCulloch, Dictionary of Commerce and Commercial Navigation (1880), scan p. 43.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
