      "oe:sitcCode/#resource": "oe:sitcUnassigned",
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "the herb *Arnica montana* is of medicinal use, an essential oil is obtained from it, and the flowers are imported in bales, being a powerful sternutatory. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 441]",
