        "@value": "a pale but clear and brilliant blue colour; a name for ultramarine, formerly made from lapis lazuli, but now artificially compounded. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 31]",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": {
