      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "the commercial and botanical name for the legumes or cylindrical pods of the pudding pipe tree; the cells are filled with a sweetish pulp which is an agreeable laxative and the base for purgative electuaries. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 86]",
