      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "the black currant (_ribes nigra_, Linn.), which was formerly celebrated for its medicinal properties with very little reason. [Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (Project Gutenberg #44562)]",
