        "@value": "a species of Italian citron having a thick rind which contains much essential oil, and is used for making perfumes, and for flavouring liqueurs. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 90]",
        "@language": "en"
