      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a red dye-stuff obtained in India from the root of *Hedyotis umbellata*, and used by dyers for the same purposes as madder. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 96]",
