      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a sub-nitrate of bismuth; oxidised carbonate of lead in the form of scales or plates; when levigated, it is called body white. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 168]",
