        "@value": "a name in Brazil for cakes made from the seeds of the *Paullinia sorbilis*, and used like cocoa for making a beverage; it contains a bitter principle, identical with caffeine. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 194]",
