      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "the principal jaborandi plant of Brazil, the leaves and bark contain an essential oil, and a peculiar alkaloid, and are famed as an agreeable, powerful, and quickly-acting sudorific. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 475]",
