      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a medicinal plant, the *Bravera anthelmintica*, a native of Abyssinia; which is reported to be a very effectual vermifuge. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 229]",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": {
        "@value": "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0122 (Drugs Unenumerated). Attested in: P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 229.",
