        "@value": "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0822 (Esparto and other Vegetable Fibres for making Paper). Attested in: Sir George Watt, The Commercial Products of India (1908), scan p. 766.",
