      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a name in Bombay for an oil obtained from the nut of the *Calophyllum inophyllum*, imported from the Somali coast, and used as a stimulant externally and internally. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 277]",
