      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "The Castor-oil Plant, Palma Christi, Ricin de Palma Christi, arand, erand, rand, bherenda, bindi, eri, areta, orer, rak-lop, anrar, gaba or jara, grundi, nerinda, rendi, harnauli, bazanjir, héran, ind, rund, amanakkam, kottei, amadan, amdi, haralu, kesu, kyetsu, etc. [Sir George Watt, The Commercial Products of India (1908), scan p. 927]",
