      "oe:sitcCode/#resource": "oe:sitcUnassigned",
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "an essential oil distilled from *Andropogon schenanthus*. Rusa water is a favourite specific for rheumatism in India. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 501]",
