      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a pungent blistering liquor, extracted from the vesicatory beetle: a piece of blotting paper soaked in it makes a ready blister. *See CANTHARIDES. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 414]",
