      "oe:sitcCode/#resource": "oe:sitcUnassigned",
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a name in the Cape colony for the *Tarchonanthus camphoratus*, the leaves of which are chewed, smoked, and employed in the form of infusion. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 337]",
