      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "a beautiful furniture-wood obtained in Demerara from a large tree, the *Omphalobium Lambertii* of Decandolle. See **IIYAWABALLI**. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 433]",
